(Government Policies: Gender Equality, Safety and Care Economy) Tj
0 -14 Td
(===========================================================) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Policy Purpose) Tj
0 -14 Td
(--------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Gender and care policy addresses safety, access to public services, economic participation,) Tj
0 -14 Td
(unpaid care burdens and responsive support systems. Services must be accessible through) Tj
0 -14 Td
(confidential, assisted and non-digital channels when needed.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Support Case Lifecycle) Tj
0 -14 Td
(----------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(A support contact, risk assessment, referral issued, referral accepted, service accessed and) Tj
0 -14 Td
(safe-resolution review are separate stages. The Gender Support Case File \(GSC-8\) records the) Tj
0 -14 Td
(preferred contact method, confidentiality restriction, referral owner, immediate safety) Tj
0 -14 Td
(action, follow-up date and consent-based information-sharing limit. A GSC-8 closure needs a) Tj
0 -14 Td
(documented safe-resolution review; it must not be inferred from a referral alone.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Care and Service Access) Tj
0 -14 Td
(-----------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Care burdens, disability, migration, insecure work and lack of connectivity can prevent a) Tj
0 -14 Td
(person from using a service even when they are registered. Outreach should therefore record) Tj
0 -14 Td
(the access barrier, the support offered and the stage reached. An enrolment, cash release or) Tj
0 -14 Td
(appointment booking does not prove that care, income support or health treatment was) Tj
0 -14 Td
(received.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Convergence Safeguards) Tj
0 -14 Td
(----------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(When health, nutrition, livelihood or legal-aid services coordinate, they should share only) Tj
0 -14 Td
(the minimum information required for the agreed purpose and preserve the correction trail. A) Tj
0 -14 Td
(programme should not expose confidential case information in a public dashboard or merge) Tj
0 -14 Td
(safety-support counts with general beneficiary totals.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Accountability) Tj
0 -14 Td
(--------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Monitoring should separately report contacts, risk assessments, referrals, service access,) Tj
0 -14 Td
(follow-up attempts and safe-resolution reviews. An administrative case closure must retain) Tj
0 -14 Td
(its reason and should not be counted as a verified safety outcome without the required) Tj
0 -14 Td
(review.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
ET
